flowchart TD
    User[User holds Control + Option or types a request] --> App[Native SwiftUI companion]
    External[Optional Flow and Omi opt-ins, independently off by default] --> Prompt[Dedicated prompt shortcut and focused text field]
    Prompt --> App
    External -. Pauses competing Clicky voice listeners .-> Voice
    App --> Voice[Apple speech recognition]
    App --> Context[ScreenCaptureKit image and Accessibility selection]
    Voice --> CLI[Drey Clicky CLI]
    Context --> CLI
    CLI -->|Default engine| Client[MCP client with bounded connection and cancellation]
    Client --> Bridge[Local jax_run MCP task bridge]
    Bridge --> Jax[Existing Jax CLI and user profile]
    Jax --> Tools[Existing Jax tools and approval rules]
    Tools -->|Gated command or computer action| Approval[Child-only Mac approval frontend: allow once or deny]
    Approval -->|Explicit once| Action[Requested tool action]
    Approval -->|Deny, timeout or cancellation| Blocked[Blocked receipt; no automatic retry]
    Jax --> Reply[Result receipt: full answer, short speech, pointer, file links]
    Reply --> App
    App --> Card[Full answer card]
    App --> TTS[Mac system voice or configured voice provider]
    CLI -->|Explicit engine codex| Codex[Codex adapter]
    Codex --> Provider[Existing ChatGPT sign-in or own-key backend]
    CLI -->|Original do route| Gate[Model classifier with 2.5 second deadline]
    Gate -->|Unavailable| Heuristic[Local heuristic]
    Bridge -. No automatic replay after dispatch .-> Error[Action outcome may be uncertain: inspect before retry]
    Context -. Untrusted evidence, never approval .-> Bridge
    Research[Public VoiceOS docs and local REA inspection] -. Comparison only .-> Notes[Comparison and verification records]
